@startuml
title USEI14 – Maximum Throughput Between Two Hubs

actor "Operations Analyst" as OA
participant "System Controller" as SC
participant "MaxFlowService" as MFS
participant "RailwayGraph" as G

OA -> SC : 1. Request max flow\n(source, target)
activate SC

SC -> SC : 2. Validate station identifiers\nand graph availability

SC -> MFS : 3. computeMaxFlow(source, target)
activate MFS

MFS -> G : 4. loadCapacities()
activate G
G --> MFS : 5. Return capacity structure
deactivate G

MFS -> G : 6. getAdjacencyData()
activate G
G --> MFS : 7. Return adjacency lists
deactivate G

MFS -> MFS : 8. Build residual network

MFS -> MFS : 9. Execute max-flow algorithm\n(Dinic or Edmonds–Karp)

MFS -> MFS : 10. Aggregate final flow value\nand edge usage

MFS --> SC : 11. Return maxFlow result
deactivate MFS

SC --> OA : 12. Present throughput value\n(and optional flow summary)
deactivate SC

OA -> OA : 13. Analyze corridor capacity

@enduml